{
  "description": "the audited site answers /llms.txt and its API catalog with a redirect to the same path over http, where each would answer: neither hop is taken, and each document reads as missing (llms.txt absent, the optional API catalog n_a), its evidence naming the redirect to http",
  "covers": [
    "llms-txt",
    "api-catalog"
  ],
  "target": "https://example.com/",
  "site_type": null,
  "spec_version": "0.0.0-corpus",
  "unmatched": {
    "status": 404,
    "headers": {
      "content-type": "text/html; charset=utf-8"
    },
    "body": "<html><body><h1>Not found</h1><p>No such page.</p></body></html>"
  },
  "allow_unmatched": true,
  "exchanges": [
    {
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://example.com/"
      },
      "response": {
        "status": 200,
        "headers": {
          "content-type": "text/html; charset=utf-8"
        },
        "body": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Example: a site with agent entry points.\">\n<link rel=\"service-desc\" href=\"/openapi.json\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" type=\"text/markdown\" href=\"/index.md\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebSite\"}</script>\n<script src=\"/js/webmcp.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>Example</h1>\n<p>Readable prose about the example service and its agent surfaces. Readable prose about the example service and its agent surfaces. Readable prose about the example service and its agent surfaces. Readable prose about the example service and its agent surfaces. </p>\n</main>\n<noscript><a href=\"/llms.txt\">llms.txt</a> <a href=\"/openapi.json\">OpenAPI</a></noscript>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://example.com/llms.txt"
      },
      "response": {
        "status": 301,
        "headers": {
          "location": "http://example.com/llms.txt"
        },
        "body": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "http://example.com/llms.txt"
      },
      "response": {
        "status": 200,
        "headers": {
          "content-type": "text/plain; charset=utf-8"
        },
        "body": "# Example\n\n> An example service with docs, an API and an MCP server.\n\n## Docs\n\n- [Guide](https://example.com/docs/guide.md): how the service works\n- [API reference](https://example.com/docs/api.md): every endpoint\n\n## When to use\n\nCall the MCP server for live data; read the docs for concepts.\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://example.com/.well-known/api-catalog"
      },
      "response": {
        "status": 301,
        "headers": {
          "location": "http://example.com/.well-known/api-catalog"
        },
        "body": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "http://example.com/.well-known/api-catalog"
      },
      "response": {
        "status": 200,
        "headers": {
          "content-type": "application/linkset+json"
        },
        "body": "{\"linkset\":[]}"
      }
    }
  ]
}
